{
  "version": 1,
  "comment": "Every kind of data that syncs (docs/design/DATA-PLATFORM.md §5). The service validates against it; the app's adapters, mirror and download rules read it. tier: T1 personal, T2 health (needs the Health consent). merge: field | whole | append. writers: any | hub. seed: edited | phoneSet | default. blobs: field -> eager | lazy. day: the field that gives the record's day, for analytics and the web. analytics: fields whose values may enter the change stream (never free text; T2 sends none). after: types whose arrival can unblock records of this type that a store could not take yet (replay). keep: \"latest\" keeps only the newest blob of each field (for derived copies, such as the Health snapshot of Apple Health, which holds the real history); the history rows stay, but the blobs they name are gone.",
